COMPILATION OF: E48D4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48D4

   1 a 0000 E48D4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P2d] the EMPTY literal on a STATIC CHARACTER VARYING.
   4 a 0006      EXPR2's own DR object puts a zero length byte plus ten blank
   5 a 0006      bytes at DATA 000F for char(10); this isolates the cell and
   6 a 0006      the PUT read of it in a whole file I can compare. */
   7 c 0006   dcl s char(10) varying static initial(''),
   8 c 0006       k fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   put list('S=', s);
  10 c 0026   stop;
  11 a 0029 end E48D4;

CODE SIZE = 0029
DATA AREA = 000F
FREE SYMS = 38B9
END  COMPILATION
